{"id":"01a046af-926b-7ccd-9f2b-33c9fa2f45b3","issue_id":"project-LICHEN-worker6-26l6.10","event_type":"closed","actor":"Mark Atwood","old_value":"","new_value":"The issue is a false positive. The code at lines 649-651 of dodag.rs correctly updates lowest_rank when select_parent() finds a valid parent. After set_rank_config() sets lowest_rank = INFINITE_RANK, the condition 'chosen_cost \u003c self.lowest_rank' will be true for any valid parent cost, causing lowest_rank to be correctly updated to chosen_cost. The described bug does not exist in the current implementation.","created_at":"2026-08-28T04:45:06.53984Z"}
